{"id":"wb-2-58","name":"宋陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宋陵","text":"宋陵，又称北宋皇陵，位于中华人民共和国河南省巩义市，是北宋的皇家墓葬群，共包括八座帝陵，包括除徽钦二帝之外的北宋其余七位帝王的陵墓，以及宋太祖赵匡胤之父宋宣祖赵弘殷的陵墓，又称“七帝八陵”。除此之外还有21座皇后袝藏陵，以及上千座陪葬墓。宋陵以大量的石像著称，地面上现存上千件石刻造像，被称为“大地上的露天石雕博物馆”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E9%99%B5","revisionId":95177471,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95177471","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d0ad7971ca9d8ba44e7d3b78.jpg","title":"20250614_Yongzhao_Mausoleum_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250614_Yongzhao_Mausoleum_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/20250614_Yongzhao_Mausoleum_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​巩义宋陵 宋仁宗永昭陵","width":320,"height":213}}